[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243483643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3243483643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3243483643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BU6H7","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T00:58:52Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T00:58:52Z","body":"Does this mean even not targeting 2D, enabling `HDR 2D` will cause 3D to use an RGBAH buffer? (Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7878)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243483643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243590122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3243590122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3243590122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BVUHq","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T02:26:30Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T02:27:19Z","body":"> Does this mean even not targeting 2D, enabling `HDR 2D` will cause 3D to use an RGBAH buffer? (Related: [godotengine/godot-proposals#7878](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7878))\r\n\r\nThat's right! Thank you for pointing that out","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243590122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243618083","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3243618083","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3243618083,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BVa8j","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T02:48:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T04:47:18Z","body":"If so, this may cause a performance regression in 3D projects with HDR2D enabled, which could be unexpected (the term \"HDR 2D\" is not accurate anymore, docs need changes).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243618083/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243680280","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3243680280","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3243680280,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BVqIY","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T03:40:54Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T03:40:54Z","body":"> If so, this may cause a performance regression in 3D projects with HDR2D enabled, which could be unexpected (the term \"HDR 2D\" is not accurate anymore).\r\n\r\nThat's right. We discussed the performance tradeoff at length in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86098 and in subsequent rendering meetings and decided that it was worth the change. If 2D is using full HDR, then the entire pipeline should use full HDR. \r\n\r\nThat being said, its not necessarily going to be a performance regression because:\r\n1. Not all games are bandwidth limited. This change only hurts bandwidth limited games\r\n2. It opens up more opportunities to share resources between 2D and 3D which can have a positive impact on performance\r\n3. Most modern phones support framebuffer compression for RGBA16 buffers now. So the original reason to limit to RGB10A2 is gone now for many devices\r\n4. Once we support HDR output, this change is 100% necessary and will improve performance since we won't have to do a needless copy to promote the RGB10A2 buffer to full RGBA16. \r\n5. If users were already using HDR2D, they are paying the cost of having a RGBA16 buffer already, so they have already decided to accept reduced performance for the benefits it provides. \r\n\r\nOverall, we felt that making this change was worthwhile. \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243680280/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3246362971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3246362971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3246362971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Bf5Fb","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T18:23:42Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T18:23:42Z","body":"> It's worth investigating for a future PR if we should also switch over the sky and reflection probes to HDR. This would improve visual consistency with Forward+ and increase the viability of HDR output for the Mobile renderer, but this needs its own proposal.\r\n\r\nSee the last paragraph in the PR description above\r\n\r\n> Reflections and sky still use LDR always since they can be shared between several Viewports and not all viewports necessarily have the same HDR2D setting. In the future we may want to consider making ReflectionProbes and Sky always use HDR. But that decision is out of scope for this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3246362971/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3260183693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3260183693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3260183693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CUnSN","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-06T01:36:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T01:32:15Z","body":"The sky is draker in Forward+ even HDR 2D is disabled, but it's normal in Mobile:\r\n<img width=\"1634\" height=\"917\" alt=\"屏幕截图_20250906_093247\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/615b2577-93fe-4a3a-af52-1d59e23b4594\" />\r\n\r\nEdit: This issue only happens with #110077, not this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3260183693/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316018457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3316018457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3316018457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fpm0Z","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T14:08:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T16:57:44Z","body":"I'm actually not immediately sure why from glancing at the code changes, but this PR breaks debanding in the following configuration:\r\n- Mobile renderer\r\n- SMAA antialiasing\r\n- HDR 2D disabled\r\n\r\nView these screenshots in a dark viewing environment at 100% scaling:\r\n| Godot 4.5 | This PR\r\n|--|--\r\n|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"godot-4 5\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1c6f6d5-af64-45c3-8d42-a93536a0403c\" />|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"this-pr\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e59bf18e-1e3b-4a44-b3c2-d6e1eb4625b1\" />\r\n\r\nMRP: [mobile-hdr-2d-debanding.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22452076/mobile-hdr-2d-debanding.zip)\r\n\r\nSMAA causes the first tonemap pass to match the scene rendering buffer format, which is 10-bit when HDR 2D is disabled, so 10-bit debanding in the tonemap shader is required for this configuration.\r\n\r\nThe code that detects what buffer format should be used for debanding makes a lot of assumptions about data formats because the exact format of a given buffer isn't really saved in an accessible way for easy access. It's possible that the debanding code now thinks that this configuration is using a 16 bit buffer for even though it is actually using a 10 bit buffer?\n\nEdit: Sorry, some of what I wrote in the first pass of this comment wasn't quite right... I think I've corrected it(?) To be honest, I need to dig deep into this every time I try and think about it because it's a little complicated to keep track of the different buffer formats used through the different passes with each renderer and HDR 2D configuration 😵‍💫","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316018457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3424595644","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#issuecomment-3424595644","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971","id":3424595644,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MHy68","user":{"login":