,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T19:56:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T19:56:36Z","body":"> @allenwp I think I may have fixed that issue in the last rebase when I fixed the conflicts. I can't repro that issue right now. Your MRP looks totally fine and matches the behaviour in Godot 4.5\r\n\r\nJust got around to testing this and reviewing the updated PR that was merged: yes, this looks good! Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3434001144/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]